  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-10-16T19:30:24.495Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Back when mods were supported, there was one that allowed you to touch the camera UI. If you wanted to adjust something, all you had to do was take either your index/pointer finger and touch the bottom buttons. That mod worked flawlessly!\nThis made taking pictures extremely easier, as all you had to do was reach out and touch the UI button. I find relying on aligning your controllers to have the \"laser\", which I found to be quite touchy with registering if you had pointed correctly, to be more cumbersome than touching the button. Almost feels like I have to fight the laser to show up sometimes.  In addition, I found that you didn’t have get out of your pose just to adjust a setting or touch the 5 sec timer to take a picture. \nI think adding a setting to turn this on and off would be nice if possible, so others who might not want this can just use it how it was originally.\nI would love to see this feature added in to help the community that loves the photography aspect, as it added more convenience and I found it to be user friendly. ^-^",
